  "overview": {
    "summary": [
      "<code>getJson</code> retried three times back to back, and it treated HTTP errors as success. It now retries with exponential backoff and fails on any non-2xx response.",
      "A new generic helper, <code>withRetry</code>, replaces <code>retryThreeTimes</code>. The client passes its attempts and base delay."
    ],
    "before": ["Three immediate retries, with no delay.", "A 500 response was parsed as JSON and returned."],
    "after": ["Three attempts, waiting 200 ms and then 400 ms between them.", "A non-2xx response throws, so it's retried, and the last error is rethrown."],
